					"name": "Psi (Level 2)",
					"base_points": 0,
					"local_notes": "Prerequisite gate, 0 points: deep integration; unlocks psi-gamma sleights. The GM should treat the strain as a more active passenger.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Mental",
						"Async"
