					"local_notes": "(2e name: Aphasia.) 2e-style rules: short range, -1 per yard beyond touch, max 10 yards; touch negates range penalties; bare skin +3. Digital minds (cyberbrains, synths, pods, infomorphs) at flat -8. 2 FP per use; sustained sleights 1 FP/min and cumulative -2 to other rolls. Skill: Aphasic Touch (Will/Hard). Quick Contest vs. Will: victim loses speech, comprehension, and reading for minutes equal to margin. Each level past 1 steps duration: x10, then hours. Statistics: Affliction (Aphasia; Malediction; Short-Range; Digital -8; Async) [15 + 5/level].",
