					"local_notes": "2e-style rules: short range, -1 per yard beyond touch, max 10 yards; touch negates range penalties; bare skin +3. Digital minds at flat -8. 2 FP per use; sustained sleights 1 FP/min and cumulative -2 to other rolls. Skill: Implant Memory (IQ/Hard). Quick Contest vs. Will (willing targets skip it): implant up to an hour of memory - real, fabricated, or blended. Fabrications that contradict the target's life, or that beggar belief, can be spotted with an IQ roll; implanted memories never overwrite real ones, they coexist, which victims describe as worse. Statistics: Telesend (Memory graft; Short-Range; Digital -8; Async) [20 + 4/level].",
