		{
			"id": "T2asMs6cOr7lUc8Ne",
			"name": "Psi-Epsilon Sleights (GM only)",
			"local_notes": "Exsurgent abilities, not available to player asyncs at any Talent level. Psi-epsilon users pay no FP: they draw what they need from the environment, which is why the lights die and the plants wither around them. The point values are for building the creature, not for buying the ability. Treat these as cinematic tools and adjust the numbers to whatever the scene needs.",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tuqmkpM_p7qLbW7cI",
					"name": "Anti-Electronics Field",
					"base_points": 60,
					"calc": {
						"points": 60
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Kills electronics in a 10-yard radius: mesh inserts, ectos, cyberbrains, weapon smartlinks. Synthmorphs and pods in the field roll HT each turn or shut down. GURPS build: Neutralize (Electronics), Area Effect. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "t2mhQ2RTljFd1YVEb",
					"name": "Basilisk Aura",
					"base_points": 80,
					"calc": {
						"points": 80
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Merely perceiving the exsurgent forces a Fright Check at -6. Failure inflicts a derangement; a critical failure inflicts a lasting disorder. The oldest and worst weapon the virus has. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "tTBMH2Ssf1rbawhml",
					"name": "Casimir Force Repulsion",
					"base_points": 40,
					"calc": {
						"points": 40
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Shoves everything away from the exsurgent in a 5-yard radius. Treat as ST 30 knockback, no attack roll, every turn it is held. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "tAhZ7r2tXMBSNoiM7",
					"name": "Cryokinesis",
					"base_points": 40,
					"calc": {
						"points": 40
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Draws heat out of an area. 3d burn (cold) at range, or drops an enclosed space below freezing over a minute. GURPS build: Innate Attack (Burning, cold), Temperature Control. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "tNXc0s4xp-nse5VG8",
					"name": "Decerebration",
					"base_points": 60,
					"calc": {
						"points": 60
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Shorts out the target brain stem. Quick Contest against Will: failure is -3 to everything and no fine motor control; critical failure means total sensory shutdown for minutes. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "ttZJOw0L7uNAdmSe8",
					"name": "Diffusion",
					"base_points": 50,
					"calc": {
						"points": 50
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "The exsurgent body loses cohesion. Treat as Diffuse: attacks that need a solid target do almost nothing, and it flows through gaps a body should not fit through. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "t3O84vTEjxkGJgyMN",
					"name": "Kinetic Friction",
					"base_points": 40,
					"calc": {
						"points": 40
					},
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Exsurgent",
						"Psi-Epsilon"
					],
					"local_notes": "Multiplies friction in a 5-yard radius. Move drops to a crawl, DX rolls at -4, and anything moving fast through it heats and seizes. [GM material: psi-epsilon]"
				},
				{
					"id": "t2D2AIk2thcHoQUbB",
					"name": "Negative Refraction",
					"base_points": 40,
					"calc": {
